				"title": "Silas",
				"lines": [
					[
						"Silas",
						"\"Took your time, Mate. Thought the sea had you.\""
					],
					[
						"Silas",
						"\"The Sovereign spat me out. The Company caught me.\""
					],
					[
						"Silas",
						"\"Get us home. We've a debt to settle.\""
					]
				],
				"journal": "Silas is alive, thinner and angrier. Three sailors with him. He says the Company knew the Sovereign would rise."
			},
